   host app (sidebar line-heights, typography). Importing it into a CSS
   layer demotes ALL of it below the app's unlayered styles — Quasar
   components keep their look (nothing else styles .q-*), while the shell
   keeps its own. Portal elements (menus, dialogs) stay styled because the
   layer is still global. */
@import 'quasar/dist/quasar.css' layer(quasar);
@import '@quasar/extras/material-icons/material-icons.css' layer(quasar);

