6	# ivue `Reactive`
7	
8	Author reactive Vue 3 logic as a plain `class $X`, then export `Class = Reactive($Class)` through `namespace X`.
9	The engine transforms the prototype once: ref-returning getters become cached
10	Refs/Computeds, plain getters de-optimize to native getters (reactive via leaf
11	tracking), methods become stable bound functions. Instances stay plain objects.
12	Follow the rules below exactly — every deviation is either a compile error or a
13	silent no-op at runtime.
14	
